# Storyboard for assets/gatemcp-compress.gif
# Requires: vhs (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs)
Output assets/gatemcp-compress.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 640
Set Height 400
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "Ask the agent: gate_compress_file on src/App.tsx depth=signature"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "# Expect originalTokens / optimizedTokens / savingsPercent on the tool payload"
Enter
Sleep 3s
